{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_title", "source_sha256": "a0248fa6981d3aac6dc06aeeaaee231ae512d2f46e9f6622f800af0bc3f3726c", "ja": "何回でも、何度でも", "zh": "无论几次、无论几遍", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e41308e36a0bf22b77a001c6fc4a086370f8d4ea55d08f7377e8c5cc67d137e2", "ja": "日々、善行に励む天空騎士団。そんな彼らに\nご褒美をあげようと、朋花は自らセンターに\n立つ事を決める。仲間達と楽しくレッスンに\n励むが、公演に来られない子豚ちゃんからの\n手紙を受け取り、朋花は胸を痛める。", "zh": "天空骑士团日日辛勤行善，为了奖励他们，\n朋花决定主动接下Center的位置。\n她与同伴们快乐地参与训练课程，\n却收到了无法亲临公演的小猪所写的信，\n这令朋花心痛不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1000_p", "source_sha256": "876fb26f78bba3da6bf96530c1f589f13a327cef595773ebda6abf1a9894351e", "ja": "（公演のメンバーは、センターの朋花。歩、紬、それに\n茜と亜利沙に決まった。さて、どんな公演に……ん？）", "zh": "（公演的成员确定是担任Center的朋花、步跟䌷，\n还有茜跟亚利沙了，接下来该想想公演主题……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "3beb074d2f58e8763331a0cf282078feb1812b73a7f28209fb42443b1e427f3e", "ja": "ふぉぉ……ナイスショットですっ！\n紬ちゃんのお宝フォト、ゲットですよ～っ！", "zh": "唔喔喔……这张太棒了！\n亚利沙得到小䌷的珍贵照片啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7c2433c45bf8da9a6e0375972bbf846fc7a244ef058449f7669bd1fd4f623b11", "ja": "ま、松田さん、今のはもしや……？\n失敗したところを撮ったのですか！？", "zh": "松、松田，你刚刚不会是……？\n拍到我出错的样子了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "a308741e7f562b2480bd253fdf88c850850027be0e452712d6c8e32342aadda3", "ja": "つむりん、心配いらないよ。今のつむりん、\n茜ちゃんに匹敵するほどかわいかったから！", "zh": "䌷䌷，不用担心啦。\n刚刚的䌷䌷可爱到与小茜不相上下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fce4e72063251282ae9213a71e9e098f217ffc433f2cdf5e191ce2a23cd7d6d6", "ja": "亜利沙～。見てばっかじゃなくて\n自分でも踊らないと、練習にならないよ！", "zh": "亚利沙～你别光看着大家，\n自己也要跳啊，否则算不上是练习喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "43028792eea0fed02a0f2c44d13f9faa9451f6f2fb795b1dd2de58e07b7e0659", "ja": "そうですね～。子豚ちゃん達の目線を持っているのが、\n亜利沙さんのいいところでもありますが……。", "zh": "就是说呀～虽然能从小猪们的观点来看事情，\n正是亚利沙的优点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "7c376da7df342eb187dd7f6b9224b97cf4761415cdc3e54a83bdb3741a9000ef", "ja": "あまりワガママを言ってみんなを困らせるようなら、\nお仕置きですよ～？", "zh": "但如果太过任性，对大家造成困扰的话，\n我会惩罚你喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "a1496cc34bb69a7edf097958e1190021fa33d099c3c116096bb34654617c2048", "ja": "わ、わかってますよ朋花ちゃん！\nありさ、真面目にレッスンしますとも！　もちろん！", "zh": "亚、亚利沙知道了，朋花！\n亚利沙当然会认真练习的！没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "fcd1b3191d60d7b0a8e866e2e53e0c8fc27ddab04cce83e0f8167cd4d66d6593", "ja": "うふふ、いい心がけです～。それではみなさん、\n今までのところで、一度合わせてみましょうか～。", "zh": "呵呵，很正确的心态～那么接下来，\n大家就目前的进度，配合一次看看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e2fa7fb4bb63c342b211248ae37fd2e577f17615377755c276c793fe1a5d761a", "ja": "オッケー！　それじゃ、みんなスタンバイして。\n曲かけるよ！", "zh": "OK！那大家准备一下，\n我要放歌啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9455322f302bdd201fc1e59842217b3c8365ab1f52edf2b5de13feb00da6d5d2", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1011_p", "source_sha256": "845a30b1d51e0f589861e73ee6d5b1cf57efedd5a9bb794b9eb0fb8e73b4356a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n疲れただろう、そろそろ休憩にしようか。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n应该都累了吧，差不多该休息了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "ba74fabf64b7c77a49dba82aad7be63a3deed5ce8b6300831eb93388a338202d", "ja": "そうですね。その前に……亜利沙さん。\n今のレッスンで、気になることはありましたか～？", "zh": "说得也是，不过在休息之前……亚利沙。\n刚刚这段练习，你有没有发现什么要注意的地方～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "3312937e4cc630a75cde86926a24c2879235efc21621436de040fb4dc2cc1cf2", "ja": "あ、ありさですか！？　えっと……あっ！\n歩ちゃんの歌い出しが、すこし早かったです！", "zh": "问、问亚利沙吗！？这个嘛……啊！\n小步开头的起音有点太快了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4a6e73afbb708b3f305cf6556620974cf88d4c2fb2c10f3c355e8d08b94d546d", "ja": "あっ、やっぱそうだった！？\nあそこの入るタイミング、ちょっと苦手なんだよな～。", "zh": "啊，果然是这样吗！？\n我抓不太到开始唱的时机呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "526e4b7e9ba2ca38cb2aa56786fec5d3a56097278bd7707d010635902398f458", "ja": "紬ちゃんは、右手の振りがちょっと遅れてました！\n茜ちゃんはダンスの途中で、謎のアドリブが……！", "zh": "小䌷的右手动作则有点慢！\n小茜是跳舞跳到一半，突然有奇怪的即兴演出……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f7799c4d98d75bbc13b873848618f62e80e31d4ba1e30d4b5a70eacc0d15302c", "ja": "でも……3人ともかわいいから、OKです♪", "zh": "不过……因为你们三个都很可爱，所以OK啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "315f2ebcf45fd2349f868ab1ccd0ae77bb5ae47737d3098458c6bba8164e2eb5", "ja": "あっ、亜利沙ちゃんもそう思った？　茜ちゃんも、\n茜ちゃんのかわいさならOKだと思ったんだ～！", "zh": "啊，小亚利也这么想吗？\n小茜也是觉得啊，因为小茜很可爱所以OK啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d4455a5fca73f2ffb11b63f77f6db14351357ed5fe30d4ecfb7f17a3359ba85", "ja": "ちっともOKではありません、松田さん、野々原さん。\nちゃんと直さなければ……！", "zh": "一点也不OK，松田、野野原。\n错误一定要确实修正……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cfffde295ce3dcb00992184bc707b1327f63a458e87caa01bebc74dd2807777a", "ja": "さすが亜利沙だな……。\nみんなの事をよく見てる。", "zh": "真不愧是亚利沙啊……\n你很用心在注意每个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "cf45a97d99e7b0eeca81ad748f97d20ade06fd0fcc03c1e62ffd86a9b7950054", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n感心している場合ではありませんよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n现在不是感到佩服的时候了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1021_p", "source_sha256": "850c492dc5df962848c4c0f4e87f5b874cc2a6ce0a2219868b62acf30ecdbc62", "ja": "うん、そうだな。それぞれ課題はあるけど、\n公演までまだ時間はある。しっかり調整していこう！", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。虽然大家都有自己的课题，\n不过离公演还有一段时间，好好调整自己吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "81079cd0a46ebb4d075a751f90d9496db0e484b5ef92e9645dac1b0c4c99d86e", "ja": "はぁ……とはいえ、あまり時間もないのに、\nこんな調子で大丈夫なのでしょうか。", "zh": "唉……话虽如此，明明也没多少时间了，\n我这个样子真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "645a02614485dbb309665a1ad54e9728c1071a69dd2483fc0b3b0ae8c9ea8e5c", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、つむりん。つむりんは着実に成長してる！\nずっとみんなを見てた茜ちゃんにはわかる！", "zh": "不要紧的，䌷䌷，你确实有在成长！\n小茜一直都看着大家，所以看得出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "1bc1c93231090440a8bbf4cbcd2b4c6d8215a77e1c156ee89d71e8d9eb00f62e", "ja": "ヘイ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nつむりんと茜ちゃんに、ご褒美のプリン、プリーズ！", "zh": "嘿，小{$P$}！\n请给䌷䌷跟小茜布丁奖励我们，Please！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8e1fa5900706ecba1de049ca02b7184bca8acea78686341d8ce3ba8bb7f0e25a", "ja": "え？　今か？", "zh": "咦？现在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "44e0da8271e81247c42ee3f6cecd646740d560489c2f29d6c6ab310304e56537", "ja": "茜さん～？　プリンはレッスンが終わってからと、\n約束しましたよね～？　約束を守れない子は……。", "zh": "茜～我们应该说好了，要练习结束后\n才能吃布丁吧～不遵守约定的孩子会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "0dbef4c5c3d79968e5d9d8fab8f657edbb894f3f20f0535fb6838bf189ddbeaf", "ja": "じょ、冗談だよ朋花ちゃん！\n茜ちゃん、今すぐ練習したくてたまらないな～！？", "zh": "开、开玩笑的啦，小朋花！\n小茜现在超想练习的，想得不得了耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e0da54db9c569be20cf6dc8757f1affb80c403ac32c4bde31624b97e305ba6d9", "ja": "あははっ！　亜利沙も茜も、\n{$P$}より朋花のほうが怖いのかな？", "zh": "啊哈哈！比起{$P$}，\n亚利沙跟茜是不是都比较怕朋花啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f2fa0aaab000596f5ee6f71e02312488a0a8785d3b6759c1b3aa1de1d50f069c", "ja": "はは、そうみたいだな。\n茜、プリンはレッスンが終わったらな。", "zh": "哈哈，好像是这样呢。\n茜，布丁就等练习完了再吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce678dc06e453bdfad4ba4f1c490105031ca0094234f6c489392ce4e31708bc1", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……まぁでも、レッスンのあとに食べられるなら\nいいもん！　茜ちゃん的にはオッケーだよ！", "zh": "唔唔唔……算了没关系，反正练完以后吃得到就好！\n在小茜看来是没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f5fc4af70f19556074e7d8e745d031a4dd38550906ac7f78bf7376319c154885", "ja": "はぁ……みなさん、余裕があるのですね。\nそれに比べて、私は……。", "zh": "唉……大家都一派轻松呢。\n相比之下，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "094fe0f970e82443a36a8e980f1264b34dfc2a865c643a670a3c6b726b56bece", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、紬さん～。\n私は、このメンバーを信じています～。", "zh": "没问题的，䌷～\n我很信任在场的成员～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "a03826a80d351b653dd0286d4b9c093be0c601a14d7dcc0e334cea57899d1d9f", "ja": "ダンスなら、歩さんが頼りになります。その代わり\n紬さんは、歩さんに歌を教えてあげてください～♪", "zh": "舞蹈的部分可以请教步姊。\n相对地，也请䌷教步姊唱歌吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0885cf7315e4f92bd47cc0d244b47988a95a28fafcea309f50289779c3d3fa22", "ja": "紬、よろしく！\nダンスのことなら、アタシにまかせてよ！", "zh": "䌷，请多指教！\n舞蹈的部分就尽管交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2fe59e51b31cf0ea8d8e7a636c3288f181f5c5ba3a14555290feff790a2b176f", "ja": "は、はい……舞浜さん、よろしくお願いします。\n本番まで、お互い助け合いましょう……！", "zh": "好、好的……舞滨，还请多多指教。\n到正式演出前，我们就互相帮忙吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c0c5d27a2b496cb89a22234b23fb22882b6d99d11e46556b75c56afd36ddee12", "ja": "（朋花のセンター公演のレッスンは順調に進んでいる。\nこれなら、何の問題もなく本番を迎えられそうだな）", "zh": "（朋花的Center公演练习进行得很顺利。\n这样一来，感觉可以一帆风顺地迎来正式演出那天。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1037_p", "source_sha256": "40b7bae65fbd517707b25210f34f79d27887898f0cff7f998a8aeb38289933dc", "ja": "……あれ？　レッスン室に、明かりがついている。\nもう、みんなとっくに帰ったはずなのに……。", "zh": "……咦？练习室的灯还亮着。\n大家应该都早就回去了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "95eddcb7b144e3f0318da153942ed80c392cd3dbf2b43674af0722b63401b5f0", "ja": "……ふぅ……。", "zh": "……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1039_p", "source_sha256": "9193960dfbe487152e46f41e016ad902ccfca438a172ecfcb7792cbfdd5814c6", "ja": "朋花じゃないか。\nどうしたんだ、こんな時間に。", "zh": "这不是朋花吗？\n你怎么这么晚还在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "53990777a3b461b816168169b9a951fb401cc6d903cb4d6b299effcbd32759f5", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん……。私は、\n子豚ちゃんからのお手紙を読んでいたところですよ～。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生……\n我刚刚在看来自小猪的信件～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1041_p", "source_sha256": "bc36e19723f9bd2abd2fd24721b29c450966111ca3ca3d5098b5483c584289b2", "ja": "子豚ちゃん……ファンレターか。\n朋花のファンの人達は、みんな熱心だからな。", "zh": "小猪……粉丝信啊。\n毕竟朋花的粉丝们个个都很热情嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1042_p", "source_sha256": "a00dea87e6b9cd31bcd7832e233c20a1451e737fad55ecb4494005726dd4b0b1", "ja": "けど、それにしてはなんだか浮かない顔だな。\n何かよくない事でも書いてあったのか？", "zh": "不过，你看起来不是很开心呢。\n上面写了什么不好的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "4eec72a9024f723776b14d790522c0605ad6572292b977fc3ccf0f2e7ce521fc", "ja": "うふふ……{$P$}さんは、\n私のことを、よく見ているんですね～？", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}先生\n看我看得很仔细呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "1631bb1e354237f7b369c10c2791f5b717b017d8f47b6df8a7c730bea19fa98e", "ja": "聖母の顔色をうかがうなんて、生意気ですよ～？", "zh": "竟敢观察圣母的脸色，你胆子很大嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1045_p", "source_sha256": "279e177c5f0de164288ccee72e8cfc7dbebbf2fb777656c6fec69f8d996512f0", "ja": "それがプロデューサーの仕事だからな。\n……で、何を気にしていたんだ？", "zh": "因为这就是制作人的工作啊。\n……所以你是在担心什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "d349b03c06339cf590bf338d69dd60b07e3b3eeb5fd09be28fb821b177e74596", "ja": "ええ。この子豚ちゃんからの手紙が、\n少し気にかかってしまって……。", "zh": "嗯，这只小猪寄来的信，\n让我有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1047_031tom", "source_sha256": "ef4958ed1ee522753c2c4d9ccbdf5a1530ce0a7b248889efb414de24a471e9cb", "ja": "『朋花様の初めてのセンター公演に行きたいけど、\nケガで入院して、行けなくなってしまいました』", "zh": "『我很想去看朋花大人的首次Center公演，\n但我受伤住院了，所以没有办法去。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "ace89171ca9fdfe988b39b675d605785677359282fae16f24b1c4dece65a6621", "ja": "『劇場に行ける、仲間の子豚ちゃん達が\nうらやましいです』……だそうです。", "zh": "『好羡慕其他可以到剧场去的小猪伙伴们啊。』\n……信里是这样写的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1049_p", "source_sha256": "fc64daf6ca9aefdc6f5a0114255e76f599197acc4c12999939889f81ed941b8d", "ja": "そうか……残念だけど、入院しているんじゃ\n公演に来るのは難しいよな……。", "zh": "原来如此……虽然很可惜，\n不过既然在住院，就没办法来看公演了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "277aff4d6969b5c51947177a42ffedf2e03c09bf78c10c97461865bd678cc23d", "ja": "はい。……私は、より多くの子豚ちゃん達のためにと、\nアイドルをはじめました～。ですが……。", "zh": "是的……我是为了更多小猪们的福利，\n才开始当偶像的～不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "fe805927e5be5b4e379e78a9bc05c27b92d556d9b942e6e37d3f3cdfd60f85a8", "ja": "やはり、全員に平等にというのは、難しいですね～。\nわかっているつもりでしたが……。", "zh": "要做到对所有人都公平，果然很难呢～\n我以为我早就了解了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1052_p", "source_sha256": "df4c77b0c5e6dd16c6ce3368c4a27f517ade62efdfe9b3b01c5b4a5cc94eda06", "ja": "朋花は優しいな。公演に来られないファン、\nひとりひとりの事まで考えてあげて。", "zh": "朋花还真体贴，即便是没办法来现场看公演的粉丝，\n你依然为他们每一个人着想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "234bfde11203e48051fee6ac0e67e234b04eb738fc639663c433a1387b3ff60e", "ja": "当然ですよ～。子豚ちゃんがいるから、\n私はアイドルになったのです～。", "zh": "那是当然的～毕竟就是因为有小猪在，\n我才会成为偶像的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1054_p", "source_sha256": "a8d4d9d0fa40b9f048ac46c04a0f70c138c46de3bca3958ce782ccc3cecc0561", "ja": "でも、現実に朋花のステージを見る事ができるのは、\n劇場に来てくれたファンだけだ。今のところは。", "zh": "不过，实际上能够看到朋花表演的，\n只有到剧场来的粉丝而已，目前是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1055_031tom", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1056_p", "source_sha256": "dcb0c2f1cb67a81f9dc133189fc890675a128ed1c70ee2c949b187d55bb5d8c3", "ja": "それでも、もっと多くの人達に声を届けたいなら、\n何回でも挑戦するしかない。", "zh": "就算这样，你还是想把自己的声音传达给更多人的话，\n就只能一次又一次地挑战了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1057_031tom", "source_sha256": "dabf9d314d137086e5bad6dd6959d0fb63f2b91d293add3cc87074d13b561ce4", "ja": "何回でも、ですか～？", "zh": "一次又一次地挑战，是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1058_p", "source_sha256": "92fb26dacf1d2376109edfa4bb93d597e29993dcd6f7ccb30e8c6b09b922c2dd", "ja": "ああ。子豚ちゃん達が、いつでも朋花に会いに\n来られるように。朋花が、ステージに立ち続けるんだ。", "zh": "是的，为了让小猪们无论何时都能见到朋花，\n朋花你要持续表演下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1059_p", "source_sha256": "76a288e1e630528fa63bc1112ea6ceb77e921370b211e2357d62002a90dda5ac", "ja": "それが、アイドルがファンに対してできる、\n最大の恩返しなんじゃないかと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，这应该就是偶像对粉丝\n最具诚意的报恩方式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1061_p", "source_sha256": "6ca0339cfad98032c013fae8157317e76d1a3eabb2c573169e35ccdc22d85c9d", "ja": "今回は残念だったけど……その手紙の人も、朋花が\nステージに立ち続ければ、絶対、見に来てくれるさ。", "zh": "这次虽然可惜……但只要朋花继续表演工作，\n写下那封信的人，一定会来见你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1062_031tom", "source_sha256": "47ae64bdfa3c61b85b3983033442af4fb94120fc649c8d06cbf1f71617d9637d", "ja": "そうですね～。アイドルの私にできるのは、\nステージに立ち続けることだけですね～。", "zh": "说得也是～我身为一个偶像，\n能做的也只有持续站在舞台上了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1063_031tom", "source_sha256": "7954622a5b51713588727bf5694e5010aad0c44616825a9e8925344f7177f2e2", "ja": "そうすれば聖母の光を、あまねく\nすべての人たちに、届ける事ができるはずです～。", "zh": "这样一来，\n圣母的光芒一定能普照众生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1064_031tom", "source_sha256": "635224304a94067be269726325100c529f85586739d33937bd6875a9e2c9e412", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n次の公演のことなのですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n关于下一场公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1066_031tom", "source_sha256": "62c42134f2b87c047f8251f5e01e0301b7bcc2cf32053b4042a8a6add52d376c", "ja": "今回の公演のことで、みなさんにご相談があります～。\n私のワガママを、聞いていただけますか～？", "zh": "关于这次公演，我有事想跟大家商量～\n各位愿意听听我任性的要求吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1071_p", "source_sha256": "d97c6f5e38da3ece1b5aaa87ace4d4481c167bfe92d8c521d3d58fa27255f908", "ja": "（朋花のファンを思う気持ちは、もしかしたら\nみんなの想像以上に強いのかもしれない……）", "zh": "（朋花为粉丝着想的心意，\n说不定比大家想像得还要强烈……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_035_1072_p", "source_sha256": "0c17618d0aeabd3a8bf053bd6078eaea92856a04ef3b68cbbb17792d8fabb4e1", "ja": "（朋花の思いは、きっとみんなの元に届くだろう。\nそのための手助けなら、いくらでもできるはずだ！）", "zh": "（朋花的心意，一定能传达给大家的吧。\n为此我可以提供任何帮助！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
